{"seq":1,"slug":"client-retry-jitter","title":"客户端重试、退避与抖动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/practice/client-retry-jitter","wordCount":1938,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"客户端重试-退避与抖动\">客户端重试、退避与抖动</h1><p>服务端辛辛苦苦做好了限流（见 <a href=\"../foundations/\">限流基础与算法</a>），返回了一个礼貌的 429，结果客户端写了句 <code>while not ok: retry()</code>——下一秒，被拒的请求原封不动又冲回来，而且全世界的客户端都在同一时刻冲。服务端的限流非但没让流量平息，反而触发了一场更猛的重试风暴。客户端侧的重试策略，是稳定性这枚硬币的另一面：服务端做对了不够，客户端做错了照样能把系统打垮。这一篇讲该不该重试、退避怎么算、以及为什么抖动是其中最容易被忽略却最关键的一环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>客户端重试是稳定性硬币的另一面，几个关键概念如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>克制重试</strong>：只对瞬时失败、<code>429</code>、<code>503</code> 重试，不对 <code>4xx</code> 客户端错误与鉴权失败重试；非幂等操作必须配幂等键。</li>\n<li><strong>指数退避</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">delay_n = \\min(cap, base \\cdot 2^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 让间隔随次数指数增长，给系统越来越多恢复时间，需配上限与最大次数。</li>\n<li><strong>惊群效应</strong>：同时失败的客户端用相同退避会「同拍重试」形成同步尖峰，退避算对了时间却没算对相位。</li>\n<li><strong>抖动</strong>：在退避里加入随机性打散相位，全抖动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">random(0, b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 通常最优，AWS SDK 已内建。</li>\n<li><strong>重试预算</strong>：给整个系统的重试总量设闸（如不超过原始请求量的 10%），防止海量客户端的重试叠加成洪峰。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话串起来：<strong>服务端做对限流还不够，客户端必须「少重试、指数退避、加抖动、设总预算」，否则被拒的请求会原封不动冲回来把系统打垮</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"不是所有失败都该重试\">不是所有失败都该重试</h2><p>重试的第一原则是克制：重试只对「瞬时的、有希望靠等待恢复的」失败有意义，对「确定性的、重试一万次也是同样结果的」失败有害无益。盲目重试不可恢复的错误，只是在浪费资源、放大负载。判断标准是错误的性质：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误类型</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>是否该重试</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>瞬时网络/超时</td>\n<td>连接超时、读超时</td>\n<td>应重试（很可能恢复）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务端过载</td>\n<td><code>503</code> Service Unavailable</td>\n<td>应重试，但必须退避</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限流拒绝</td>\n<td><code>429</code> Too Many Requests</td>\n<td>按 <code>Retry-After</code> 重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户端错误</td>\n<td><code>400</code> <code>404</code> <code>422</code></td>\n<td>不重试（重试结果不变）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>鉴权失败</td>\n<td><code>401</code> <code>403</code></td>\n<td>不重试（需先修凭证）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键区分是 <code>429</code>/<code>503</code> 与 <code>4xx</code> 客户端错误。前者是「现在不行，待会儿可能行」，后者是「这个请求本身就错了」。一个尤其重要的细节：对非幂等操作（如「扣款」「下单」）的重试必须格外小心，盲目重试可能导致重复扣款。安全重试要么只对幂等操作做，要么配合幂等键（idempotency key）让服务端能识别并去重同一逻辑请求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指数退避-给系统喘息的时间\">指数退避：给系统喘息的时间</h2><p>确定要重试后，「隔多久重试」就成了核心问题。固定间隔重试（每隔 1 秒重试一次）在过载场景下是灾难——它给系统施加的是恒定压力，系统正过载需要的恰恰是压力下降。指数退避（exponential backoff）让重试间隔随尝试次数指数增长，给系统越来越多的恢复时间。第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次重试的基础等待时间为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">delay_n = base \\cdot 2^{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">base</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span></span></span></span></span> 是基准间隔（如 100ms）。于是等待序列是 100ms、200ms、400ms、800ms……指数增长。实践中还要加两个约束：一个上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">cap</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>（避免等待无限增长，AWS SDK 默认上限 20 秒），以及一个最大重试次数（避免无休止重试，通常 3–5 次）。带上限的退避是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">delay_n = \\min(cap, base \\cdot 2^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>但单纯的指数退避有一个致命的隐藏缺陷，它在下一节登场。</p>\n<h2 id=\"抖动-消灭同步的惊群\">抖动：消灭同步的惊群</h2><p>设想这样的场景：一次下游故障让 10000 个客户端在同一毫秒内都收到了失败。它们都用同样的指数退避——于是它们都在第 100ms 重试、都在第 300ms 重试、都在第 700ms 重试。指数退避确实拉长了间隔，但它没有打散这些客户端，它们仍然像合唱团一样在同一拍子上集体重试，每一拍都是一个尖锐的流量峰值砸向刚要恢复的系统。这就是惊群（thundering herd）效应——退避算对了时间，却没算对相位。</p>\n<p>抖动（jitter）就是解药：在退避时间里加入随机性，把本来同步的重试在时间轴上摊开，让服务端收到的是平稳的细流而非同步的尖峰。AWS Builders&#39; Library 那篇经典文章对比了几种抖动策略，结论是「全抖动」（full jitter）通常最优。下面是三种主流策略的对照（设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b = \\min(cap, base \\cdot 2^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无抖动</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">delay = b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>同步惊群，最差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全抖动（full jitter）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">delay = random(0, b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>均匀摊开，峰值最低，AWS 推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等量抖动（equal jitter）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">delay = b/2 + random(0, b/2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>保证一个最小等待，避免过短</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>去相关抖动（decorrelated）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">delay = \\min(cap, random(base, prev \\cdot 3))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>基于上次值递增，自适应更好</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>AWS SDK 的标准重试模式现在内建了全抖动，其延迟公式正是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>20000</mn><mtext>ms</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">delay = random(0, 1) \\times \\min(20000\\text{ms}, base \\cdot 2^{retry})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">20000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0436em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。结论很明确：<strong>指数退避必须配抖动，否则等于没解决惊群</strong>。下图展示有无抖动的区别。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  FAIL[10000 客户端同时失败] --&gt; NOJIT[纯指数退避 无抖动]&#10;  FAIL --&gt; JIT[指数退避 + 全抖动]&#10;  NOJIT --&gt; SPIKE[所有客户端同拍重试&lt;br/&gt;形成同步尖峰]&#10;  SPIKE --&gt; KILL[尖峰再次压垮恢复中的系统]&#10;  JIT --&gt; SPREAD[重试均匀摊在时间轴]&#10;  SPREAD --&gt; SMOOTH[服务端收到平稳细流&lt;br/&gt;得以恢复]\">flowchart TD\n  FAIL[10000 客户端同时失败] --&gt; NOJIT[纯指数退避 无抖动]\n  FAIL --&gt; JIT[指数退避 + 全抖动]\n  NOJIT --&gt; SPIKE[所有客户端同拍重试&lt;br/&gt;形成同步尖峰]\n  SPIKE --&gt; KILL[尖峰再次压垮恢复中的系统]\n  JIT --&gt; SPREAD[重试均匀摊在时间轴]\n  SPREAD --&gt; SMOOTH[服务端收到平稳细流&lt;br/&gt;得以恢复]</pre><h2 id=\"重试预算-给整个系统的重试设总闸\">重试预算：给整个系统的重试设总闸</h2><p>即便每个客户端都做了退避加抖动，海量客户端的重试叠加起来仍可能淹没一个本就脆弱的系统——尤其当故障持续时，每个客户端都在反复重试，总重试量是巨大的。重试预算（retry budget）是给这个总量设的闸：限制重试请求占总请求的比例，比如「重试量不得超过原始请求量的 10%」。一旦超过，就停止重试、直接失败，宁可让少量请求快速失败，也不让重试把系统彻底拖垮。</p>\n<p>重试预算体现了一个更深的原则——在系统层面，重试是有总成本的，不能让局部的「再试一次」无限叠加成全局的洪峰。它和 <code>Retry-After</code>（见 <a href=\"../distributed/api-gateway-throttling\">网关限流与配额</a>）配合最佳：服务端通过 <code>Retry-After</code> 精确告诉客户端何时重试，客户端用预算控制重试总量，两端协作把重试流量塑造成系统能承受的形状。当重试仍不足以应对持续故障时，就该让熔断器接管，彻底切断对故障下游的调用（见 <a href=\"circuit-breaker-bulkhead\">熔断、隔板与超时</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>重试要克制：只对瞬时失败、<code>429</code>、<code>503</code> 重试，不对 <code>4xx</code> 客户端错误和鉴权失败重试；非幂等操作的重试必须配幂等键防止重复副作用。</li>\n<li>指数退避 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">delay_n = \\min(cap, base \\cdot 2^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 让重试间隔随次数指数增长、给系统恢复时间，需配上限和最大重试次数。</li>\n<li>纯指数退避有惊群缺陷：同时失败的客户端会同拍重试形成同步尖峰；必须加抖动打散相位，全抖动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">random(0, b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 通常最优，AWS SDK 已内建。</li>\n<li>重试预算给整个系统的重试总量设闸（如不超过原始请求的 10%），防止海量客户端的重试叠加成洪峰，与服务端 <code>Retry-After</code>（见 <a href=\"../distributed/api-gateway-throttling\">网关限流与配额</a>）协作。</li>\n<li>当重试不足以应对持续故障时，由熔断器彻底切断对故障下游的调用，见 <a href=\"circuit-breaker-bulkhead\">熔断、隔板与超时</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"客户端重试、退避与抖动","id":"客户端重试-退避与抖动"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"不是所有失败都该重试","id":"不是所有失败都该重试"},{"level":2,"text":"指数退避：给系统喘息的时间","id":"指数退避-给系统喘息的时间"},{"level":2,"text":"抖动：消灭同步的惊群","id":"抖动-消灭同步的惊群"},{"level":2,"text":"重试预算：给整个系统的重试设总闸","id":"重试预算-给整个系统的重试设总闸"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"负载卸载与优先级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/distributed/load-shedding-priority"},"next":{"title":"熔断、隔板与超时","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/practice/circuit-breaker-bulkhead"}}